# minimal-cli

Minimal Foundry CLI example for validate, plan, and generate

## Build and run

```bash
go build -o bin/minimal-cli ./cmd/minimal-cli
./bin/minimal-cli --help
```

## Develop

Canonical commands (also in `AGENTS.md` and `docs/commands.md`):

```bash
gofmt -w .
go test -count=1 ./...
go vet ./...
go tool staticcheck ./...
```

